  "job_B9.6.5_20261117_220416": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6rde. \u00dea he \u00fea se cyning his gel\u00e6rednesse & his geornfulnisse geseah, b\u00e6d he hine, \u00fe\u00e6t he gewunade Ond he his benum ge\u00feafode; & he monig ger \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan \u00feeode on biscoplicum onwealde fore \u00d0a \u00e6t nehstan se cyning, se \u00f0e Seaxna gereorde an cu\u00f0e, w\u00e6s a\u00f0roten his elreordre spr\u00e6ce: aspon Ond he \u00fea tod\u00e6lde in twa biscopscire Westseaxna m\u00e6g\u00f0e, ond \u00fe\u00e6m Wine gesealde biscopse\u00f0l in \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00e6gelberht swi\u00f0e abolgen, for\u00feon se cyning buton his ge\u00feeahte swa dyde; gewat \u00fea of Ond \u00fe\u00e6r he onfeng his agenre ceastre bisscopscire, Parisiace hatte; & he \u00fe\u00e6r ald & godra d\u00e6da ful \u00d0a w\u00e6s \u00e6fter noht monegum gearum \u00e6fter his onweggewitenesse of Breotone, \u00fe\u00e6tte Wine w\u00e6s \u00dea gewat he to Wulfhere Mercna cyninge; ond mid feo gebohte \u00e6t him \u00fe\u00e6t biscopse\u00f0l \u00e6t Ond swa Westseaxna m\u00e6g\u00f0 micelre tide w\u00e6s buton biscope. \u00de\u00e6re seolfan tide \u00fea eac swelce se foresprecena cyning \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeode mid \u00feam hefigestum \u00d0a cwom him \u00e6t nehstan to gemynde, \u00fe\u00e6t hine \u00e6r his getreowleasnis of his rice adraf, ond eft, & \u00fea eac ongeat \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6fde on \u00feweorh gedon, \u00fe\u00e6tte seo m\u00e6g\u00f0 w\u00e6s buton bisscoPe, & \u00fe\u00e6t heo For\u00f0on he \u00fea sende \u00e6rendwracan in Gallia rice to \u00e6gel",
